  {
   "id": 65346,
   "url": "https://sagamiharachuoku.goguynet.jp/2026/08/02/natsu-no-ja-matsuri/",
   "date": "2026-08-02",
   "title": "【相模原市中央区】JA相模原市 本店・中央支店で毎年恒例「夏のJAまつり」が開催されます！",
   "html": "<p>毎年恒例の「夏のJAまつり」が、2026年8月7日（金）にJA相模原市 本店・中央支店で開催されます。会場は支店駐車場で、時間は午後6時からです。</p>\n<div id=\"attachment_65347\" style=\"width: 1290px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-65347\" class=\"wp-image-65347 size-full\" src=\"https://sagamiharachuoku.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/73/2026/07/27783155.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"960\" srcset=\"https://sagamiharachuoku.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/73/2026/07/27783155.png 1280w, https://sagamiharachuoku.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/73/2026/07/27783155-768x576.png 768w, https://sagamiharachuoku.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/73/2026/07/27783155-1024x767.png 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px\" /><p id=\"caption-attachment-65347\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">※画像はイメージです。</p></div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>相模原市のJAまつりは、毎年多くの人でにぎわう夏の恒例イベント。当日は、盆踊り大会をはじめ、新鮮な野菜販売や模擬店、健康づくりに役立つ健康講話など、さまざまな催しが予定されています。</p>\n<div id=\"attachment_65349\" style=\"width: 1290px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-65349\" class=\"wp-image-65349 size-full\" src=\"https://sagamiharachuoku.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/73/2026/07/33723067_l.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"853\" srcset=\"https://sagamiharachuoku.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/73/2026/07/33723067_l.jpg 1280w, https://sagamiharachuoku.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/73/2026/07/33723067_l-768x512.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px\" /><p id=\"caption-attachment-65349\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">※画像はイメージです。</p></div>\n<p>地域のみなさんが気軽に集まり、交流を楽しめるのもJAまつりの魅力のひとつ。夏の夕方、ご家族や友人と一緒に、にぎやかなひとときを過ごしてみてはいかがでしょう♪</p>\n<div id=\"attachment_65348\" style=\"width: 1290px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-65348\" class=\"wp-image-65348 size-full\" src=\"https://sagamiharachuoku.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/73/2026/07/1679118_l.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"853\" srcset=\"https://sagamiharachuoku.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/73/2026/07/1679118_l.jpg 1280w, https://sagamiharachuoku.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/73/2026/07/1679118_l-768x512.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px\" /><p id=\"caption-attachment-65348\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">※画像はイメージです。</p></div>\n<p>当日の催しや最新情報については、<a href=\"https://www.ja-sagamiharashi.or.jp/archives/23323\">JA相模原市の案内</a>をご確認ください。</p>\n"
  },
  {
   "id": 65370,
   "url": "https://sagamiharachuoku.goguynet.jp/2026/07/31/gooday-place-sagamihara/",
   "date": "2026-07-31",
   "title": "【相模原市中央区】8月1日から開催！グッディプレイス相模原でお買い物を楽しみながら豪華プレゼントに応募しよう♪",
   "html": "<p>グッディプレイス相模原では、2026年8月1日（土）から8月30日（日）まで、「夏休み特別企画 夜空に願いをキャンペーン！」が開催されます。</p>\n<div id=\"attachment_65371\" style=\"width: 1290px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-65371\" class=\"wp-image-65371 size-full\" src=\"https://sagamiharachuoku.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/73/2026/07/27532403.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"960\" srcset=\"https://sagamiharachuoku.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/73/2026/07/27532403.png 1280w, https://sagamiharachuoku.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/73/2026/07/27532403-768x576.png 768w, https://sagamiharachuoku.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/73/2026/07/27532403-1024x767.png 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px\" /><p id=\"caption-attachment-65371\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">※画像はイメージです。</p></div>\n<p>期間中、対象店舗で1,000円（税込）以上お買い物をすると、応募用紙がもらえます。応募すると、抽選で3名様にお好きな商品（税込50,000円以内）が当たるキャンペーンです。</p>\n<blockquote class=\"instagram-media\" data-instgrm-captioned data-instgrm-permalink=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/DbSMlhPyuS4/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" data-instgrm-version=\"14\" style=\" background:#FFF; border:0; border-radius:3px; box-shadow:0 0 1px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.5),0 1px 10px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.15); margin: 1px; max-width:500px; min-width:326px; padding:0; width:99.375%; width:-webkit-calc(100% - 2px); width:calc(100% - 2px);\">\n<div style=\"padding:16px;\"> <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/DbSMlhPyuS4/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" style=\" background:#FFFFFF; line-height:0; padding:0 0; text-align:center; text-decoration:none; width:100%;\" target=\"_blank\"> </p>\n<div style=\" display: flex; flex-direction: row; align-items: center;\">\n<div style=\"background-color: #F4F4F4; border-radius: 50%; flex-grow: 0; height: 40px; margin-right: 14px; width: 40px;\"></div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; flex-grow: 1; justify-content: center;\">\n<div style=\" background-color: #F4F4F4; border-radius: 4px; flex-grow: 0; height: 14px; margin-bottom: 6px; width: 100px;\"></div>\n<div style=\" background-color: #F4F4F4; border-radius: 4px; flex-grow: 0; height: 14px; width: 60px;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"padding: 19% 0;\"></div>\n<div style=\"display:block; height:50px; margin:0 auto 12px; width:50px;\"><svg width=\"50px\" height=\"50px\" viewBox=\"0 0 60 60\" version=\"1.1\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"https://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1\" fill=\"none\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\"><g transform=\"translate(-511.000000, -20.000000)\" fill=\"#000000\"><g><path d=\"M556.869,30.41 C554.814,30.41 553.148,32.076 553.148,34.131 C553.148,36.186 554.814,37.852 556.869,37.852 C558.924,37.852 560.59,36.186 560.59,34.131 C560.59,32.076 558.924,30.41 556.869,30.41 M541,60.657 C535.114,60.657 530.342,55.887 530.342,50 C530.342,44.114 535.114,39.342 541,39.342 C546.887,39.342 551.658,44.114 551.658,50 C551.658,55.887 546.887,60.657 541,60.657 M541,33.886 C532.1,33.886 524.886,41.1 524.886,50 C524.886,58.899 532.1,66.113 541,66.113 C549.9,66.113 557.115,58.899 557.115,50 C557.115,41.1 549.9,33.886 541,33.886 M565.378,62.101 C565.244,65.022 564.756,66.606 564.346,67.663 C563.803,69.06 563.154,70.057 562.106,71.106 C561.058,72.155 560.06,72.803 558.662,73.347 C557.607,73.757 556.021,74.244 553.102,74.378 C549.944,74.521 548.997,74.552 541,74.552 C533.003,74.552 532.056,74.521 528.898,74.378 C525.979,74.244 524.393,73.757 523.338,73.347 C521.94,72.803 520.942,72.155 519.894,71.106 C518.846,70.057 518.197,69.06 517.654,67.663 C517.244,66.606 516.755,65.022 516.623,62.101 C516.479,58.943 516.448,57.996 516.448,50 C516.448,42.003 516.479,41.056 516.623,37.899 C516.755,34.978 517.244,33.391 517.654,32.338 C518.197,30.938 518.846,29.942 519.894,28.894 C520.942,27.846 521.94,27.196 523.338,26.654 C524.393,26.244 525.979,25.756 528.898,25.623 C532.057,25.479 533.004,25.448 541,25.448